id: pm-tld20c
title: "pm get cannot report linked files, tests, or docs in any projection, so the one command an agent uses to rebuild an item's context silently reports them as absent"
description: ""
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[6]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:sdk",context-management,projection,truthfulness
created_at: "2026-08-10T05:53:08.427Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-10T06:10:15.593Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "pm get --full returns every stored section, or emits an explicit withheld-sections list naming what it dropped and which command retrieves it; A silent-omission test asserts that for an item with every section populated, no section can be absent from --full without being named"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
repro_steps: 1. pm update <id> --file path=a.ts --test command=<cmd>  2. pm files <id> and pm test <id> --list both show the rows  3. pm get <id> --full --json shows neither key
expected_result: A projection named --full either carries every stored section or names the sections it withheld.
actual_result: "linked_files and linked_tests are absent from the payload entirely. An agent reconstructing context from pm get alone concludes the item has no linked code and no linked tests, which is indistinguishable from a failed write."
component: "sdk/query/get, cli output projection"
